hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to the  edition of ask Evan today I'm answering  a question from one of my newsletter  readers Daniel who wrote a lengthy email  so I'll try to kind of short it down  here for you guys so Evan I want to know  how to run an entrepreneurship training  and consulting company successfully I've  made several attempts in last year with  not-so-great results and it goes on what  what can I do to create greater  awareness and increase interest in this  field Thank You Daniel so great question  Daniel congratulations want to set up a  business I know it's really hard and  tough and there's definitely lot of  failures along the way I think with this  approach it's really hard to create  interest in a new field trying to create  a market is one of the hardest things  that you can do as an entrepreneur where  it's better to look at an existing  market and solve a challenge that  they're facing so for you if you're  selling entrepreneurship consulting and  training services some things to keep in  mind entrepreneurs generally don't have  a lot of money now if you're looking at  start-up entrepreneurs especially you  know they don't have a lot of money and  everything they make is going back into  their business or just to feed their  families you know it's it's it's hard  being a new entrepreneur and so it can  be really tough to to create really  valuable things that people will pay for  on when you're selling to entrepreneurs  and so you know I love helping startups  I love helping entrepreneurs most of  what I do is free just because it's it I  love doing it you know I love helping  entrepreneurs and so like these YouTube  videos I don't get paid to do these  YouTube videos but I want to answer your  question you know I get you ask me the  question I want to help out and I hope  other just can learn from these videos  as well and can grow their businesses so  you have to figure out a way to to make  money from what you're doing and so what  I would try to do is look at people who  may have more money who are interested  in that field and so the two ideas that  come to mind one are looking at  government so are there any government  organizations that are funding training  and  element and consulting services that you  might be able to tag along with I don't  know what's happened in your market and  here in Toronto we have a number of  different government programs where they  bring in people to come and deliver  training to entrepreneurs because it  helps the economy you know the more  entrepreneurs can build themselves up  hire people build their companies that  helps the local economy so government  sometimes have money that they can  invest into that to look at different  programs it can take longer to get in  with the government just because  governments tend to move slowly but it's  a good long-term solution to start to  look at the other thing I look at is  corporations and this is part of what I  do a lot of corporate companies will  come to me and say we're trying to reach  out to the entrepreneur community we're  trying to be seen as a friend to the  entrepreneurs and provide a lot of value  to them and the hope is you know the  more you interact with a company and see  that they're trying to help you out that  when you need products or services  you're going to go to them so if you  know just a lot of with Telus as an  example they sell phones here and phone  services in in Canada and I'll create a  little blog content for them and the  idea is the more content I create the  more people visit their website the more  telecine is a friend of the entrepreneur  community and when you're ready to buy  your phone you're likely more to go with  Telus and somebody else and so  approaching corporations who have an  interest in selling to small business  owners could be a great way to go you're  you're adding value for them you're  helping them get their message across I  never work with companies where it's  just a sales pitch it's more adding the  value and having them seen as a again  that friend of the entrepreneur  corporations have more money and can  invest into it and hopefully you get  paid what you're worth and you're still  able to follow your passion of helping  entrepreneurs and and helping them get  developed and trained and seeing them be  successful and be able to grow their  businesses out so I think the model can  work it's just maybe changing slightly  who pays you so you're changing your  structure a little bit but still serving  the same target audience there are two  biggest challenges again are looking at  you know trying to get money out of  startups which can be really hard and  you know you're never going to get paid  what you're worth and the second one is  that trying to create a new market is we  just really tough you know you want to  try to look at an established market and  build into it then to try to create a  brand new market yourself the only real  way that I can see to make money from  the startup entrepreneurs if that's  still your market that you want to go to  is you partner up with them and you  become a partner in the business you own  a piece of their business and you help  them grow and if you're you know really  good at what you do and they're really  good at what they do  it could all potentially work out but it  really depends on having the right  people together matching the skill sets  but also matching the personalities and  making sure you guys are going to get  along it's like getting the marriage you  know I ask you something that you're  both in for a very long period of time  and so that's really the way to make  money off of a startup type of business  but it's it's hard on your cash flow  because you're not making money right  away and it's really hard to pick the  right businesses to partner up with so  hopefully I gave you a few ideas in  there that you can use to to get your  business off the ground I'm excited for  you and hopefully you'll keep us posted  with your progress for those of you  watching the video if you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  makes you want to do more for you and I  love to hear we have to think if you  want to leave a comment under the video  either about this video or a question  that you may have about your own company  so thank you and I'll see you on the  next episode  you
 

